[
	{"id": "b2a0000000000001", "type": "tab", "label": "inwendo ERP: preheat a hall", "disabled": false, "info": "Heats a hall before every booking and lowers the temperature after it.\n\nThe ERP sends 'booking_pre_start' (lead time: bookable addon data automation_pre_start_minutes, else the ERP setting, default 30 minutes) and 'booking_post_end'. Needs the ERP setting integration_booking_timed_events_enabled; without it switch the booking schedule node to 'Node-RED reads the bookings'.\n\nThe MQTT out node sends to a Zigbee2MQTT thermostat; change the topic and the payload for your thermostat."},
	{"id": "b2a0000000000002", "type": "inwendo-erp-config", "name": "inwendo ERP", "host": "https://demo.iw-erp.de"},
